{"data":[{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-08-09T03:22:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2086291987054100908"],"id":"2086291987054100908","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":65,"impression_count":71827,"like_count":182,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":119,"retweet_count":7},"text":"日本很多小钢珠老虎机店，\n都会把的机台实时数据发到网上供人参考，\nvibecoding了一个APP，\n指定家附近的几家店，\n让AI十分钟采集一次机台实时数据信息，\n根据自己的一些经验和结合AI判断计算设定，\n让APP来分析出在哪一天，\n什么时候该打哪一台。\n不能说百分百赢吧，\n胜率比自己瞎玩确实高不少…🙂 https://t.co/kZ1KqdMk6h","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2086291987054100908"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-08-07T03:28:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2085568815694565654"],"id":"2085568815694565654","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10,"impression_count":45800,"like_count":76,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":92,"retweet_count":1},"text":"什么有的人会认为自己平时赚不到钱，\n一旦做自媒体了就会赚到钱？","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2085568815694565654"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-08-06T05:02:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2085229890916528372"],"id":"2085229890916528372","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":17,"impression_count":55217,"like_count":164,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":82,"retweet_count":3},"text":"现在风俗店的妹子开始用AI给自己加工照片了，\n然后优点是女孩子都开始露脸了，\n但缺点是尼玛跟本人完全不一样啊。😂\n这还不如之前马赛克呢…\n马赛克好歹看出点端倪就可以不去了，\n现在一个个AI的自己像艺人一样，\n然后见面吓人一跳。","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2085229890916528372"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-08-05T12:14:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2084976362981605437"],"id":"2084976362981605437","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":77,"impression_count":172130,"like_count":360,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":161,"retweet_count":10},"text":"入管局派人在大哥的公司楼下和登录住所附近盯梢了三个月，\n结果三个月没看到大哥去公司，\n也没在登录住所看到大哥，\n就联系给大哥办签证的行政书士面谈，\n解释了半天也没用，\n说没有在日本长期待的必要，\n直接给劝返了。\n大哥刚买个塔楼，直接懵逼了😂\n现在入管局为了撵人，\n工作是越来越拼了…","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2084976362981605437"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-08-05T01:30:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2084814188502032420"],"id":"2084814188502032420","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":30,"impression_count":38424,"like_count":70,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":60,"retweet_count":1},"text":"又到了每年的全国优秀风俗娘大选举了，\n尽管这个评选出来的可信度很高，\n但你真的去看到他们评选出来的No.1就会发现，\n日本人的审美和中国人还是有一些区别的。\n但能够进行参选的女孩，\n都是每个店里相对优秀的。\n你们可以用会员频道给你们的cityheaven账号去试着在线预约评分，\n女孩子会感谢你们的。 https://t.co/a89bE2BDKg","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2084814188502032420"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-08-04T07:45:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2084546188075045309"],"id":"2084546188075045309","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":22,"impression_count":104267,"like_count":193,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":135,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我真尼玛服了，\n也不认识她，\n已经让她靠一路了，\n我手还不敢撤，\n怕她猛一下磕扶手上再赖我…\n咋就能这么困呢…🥲 https://t.co/3bUQq0lZOj","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2084546188075045309"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-08-03T17:57:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2084337873093026108"],"id":"2084337873093026108","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":26063,"like_count":54,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":70,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我每年都要带十多个人一起去 #長岡花火大会 https://t.co/5mOt5XV6fc","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2084337873093026108"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-08-03T07:27:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2084179287536726054"],"id":"2084179287536726054","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":102,"impression_count":234662,"like_count":697,"quote_count":26,"reply_count":307,"retweet_count":35},"text":"熊本地震aeon被炸死的女孩子，\n原本都已经跑出来了，\n结果因为上司要求她把营业款锁到保险柜里。\n她又返回去了，\n然后就发生爆炸了…\n这就是日本的服从性，但没啥脑子… https://t.co/9OqHdK2mYj","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2084179287536726054"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-08-03T00:43:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2084077684414668961"],"id":"2084077684414668961","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":82,"impression_count":67862,"like_count":434,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":127,"retweet_count":3},"text":"刚开始喝咖啡就要求验货… https://t.co/7kDQIgxEdB","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2084077684414668961"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-08-02T01:48:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2083731751428591797"],"id":"2083731751428591797","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":60,"impression_count":116010,"like_count":438,"quote_count":10,"reply_count":189,"retweet_count":12},"text":"总有人问我要怎么融入日本，\n和日本人做朋友…\n首先你日语要好，\n第二你要做一个对别人有用的人。\n你对别人有用全世界人都愿意和你交朋友。\n你没用你自己家人都会嫌你是个累赘。🙂","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2083731751428591797"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-08-01T07:03:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2083448543227035691"],"id":"2083448543227035691","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":17,"impression_count":48465,"like_count":62,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":59,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我准备开班教人到处抓娃娃了…🙃 https://t.co/ZM4AuxLRwE","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2083448543227035691"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-07-31T15:53:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2083219394889687466"],"id":"2083219394889687466","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":27,"impression_count":77002,"like_count":101,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":79,"retweet_count":2},"text":"你永远可以相信我在高级频道里给你们的推荐🙂 https://t.co/WdNqfhauyc","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2083219394889687466"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-07-31T06:38:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2083079791335608643"],"id":"2083079791335608643","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":21,"impression_count":49165,"like_count":103,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":100,"retweet_count":1},"text":"日本的AI公司，给人感觉就是坑蒙拐骗啊…\n果然在日本最值钱的就是营业，\n一个好营业多垃圾的产品都能卖出去… https://t.co/OCOT0qJrXK","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2083079791335608643"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-07-30T11:05:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2082784674943004798"],"id":"2082784674943004798","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":30,"impression_count":104160,"like_count":97,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":28,"retweet_count":3},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2082657304210776309","type":"quoted"}],"text":"真牛逼!!! https://t.co/VwhM76OE5s","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2082784674943004798"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-07-29T06:54:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2082359126773145739"],"id":"2082359126773145739","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":35001,"like_count":25,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":62,"retweet_count":0},"text":"AI新时代民工… https://t.co/MriTBowo8J","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2082359126773145739"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-07-28T01:34:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2081916174108107175"],"id":"2081916174108107175","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":47531,"like_count":113,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":54,"retweet_count":0},"text":"我带出来的妹子，\n在世界各地场子做妈咪…\n我是妈咪培训中心吗🧐 https://t.co/1SutHsmxVO","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2081916174108107175"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-07-27T06:13:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2081623909737365897"],"id":"2081623909737365897","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":26,"impression_count":43378,"like_count":80,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":59,"retweet_count":0},"text":"吉原这些店本来就服务质量越来越差，\n现在连接送服务都没了，\n同样是坐电车那我还是去川崎吧…\n至少那里还没被海外游客嚯嚯的太严重。😊 https://t.co/DEvOPx9eny","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2081623909737365897"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-07-26T14:15:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2081382915460714867"],"id":"2081382915460714867","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":27,"impression_count":43715,"like_count":129,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":75,"retweet_count":4},"text":"每年都要来柏崎的海上花火大会，\n就为了看这个尺玉一百发同时打上!!! https://t.co/lggGgNeB8E","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2081382915460714867"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-07-25T06:07:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2080897752012370193"],"id":"2080897752012370193","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":66,"impression_count":48558,"like_count":98,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":34,"retweet_count":2},"text":"去了日本这么多リフレ\n只有さきゅりふ让我感觉到真心不养闲人…\n女孩数量不多，但一个比一个能打! https://t.co/EMebO7gd5B","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2080897752012370193"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-07-25T01:06:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2080821887647817943"],"id":"2080821887647817943","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":37533,"like_count":54,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":115,"retweet_count":0},"text":"会员担心自己永住申请的问题的，\n问高级频道里置顶的签证客服，\n他比我专业，\n他可以告诉你怎么去搞比较稳妥，\n别私信问我，我签证方面懂得不多。","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2080821887647817943"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-07-24T16:38:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2080694073082663085"],"id":"2080694073082663085","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":31,"impression_count":84407,"like_count":144,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":104,"retweet_count":4},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2080607440866034160","type":"quoted"}],"text":"所以我一直劝身边的人，\n上岸要趁早，还要不跟风，\n有很多人都说想赚完最后一笔再考虑，\n结果就发现自己赚钱的速度的永远跟不上政策的变化的速度。\n还有当你发现已经有大多数人都开始涌入一个国家，那你就别再跟风去凑热闹了… https://t.co/EoivNI64f1","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2080694073082663085"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-07-24T07:48:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2080560735919423664"],"id":"2080560735919423664","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":28383,"like_count":44,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":70,"retweet_count":0},"text":"上野的天漏了吗？🧐 https://t.co/AH4VSxWlZE","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2080560735919423664"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-07-23T05:15:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2080159742396396014"],"id":"2080159742396396014","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":11,"impression_count":57411,"like_count":110,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":121,"retweet_count":0},"text":"现在面试的人真的莫名其妙，\n简历写的可漂亮了，\n面试的时候这个架构那个语言说的可明白了，还有各种我都没听过的环境，算法。到最后连我都不知道他在说啥了…\n最后来公司试用期都没过，\n没干几天就发现他真的是只会说不会干…😅","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2080159742396396014"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-07-22T11:32:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2079892452354449822"],"id":"2079892452354449822","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":15,"impression_count":55142,"like_count":113,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":126,"retweet_count":0},"text":"感觉自己赚的越多，\n越不敢乱搞了，\n人也不敢乱见了，\n啥事都变得束手束脚起来，\n做啥事都要先问好多律师，\n没问题才敢搞…\n越来越没年轻时候那种天不怕地不怕的闯劲了…","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2079892452354449822"},{"author_id":"222316578","created_at":"2026-07-21T13:05:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2079553457586114619"],"id":"2079553457586114619","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":54,"impression_count":81741,"like_count":247,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":124,"retweet_count":4},"text":"现在大阪这帮华人也不去店里玩了，\n都是自己整个会所，\n然后喊自己的朋友喊女孩子去会所里喝。\n没条件的就自己预约个大点的卡拉OK包房，\n然后喊女孩子去包房里喝。\n省了店里的酒水钱，\n女孩子费用也超级便宜。\n而且最后心情好了还能直接带走。\n联系了一个专门帮这些局派人的，\n让她做我新的大阪客服🙂","url":"https://x.com/iam678/status/2079553457586114619"}],"errors":[{"detail":"Could not find tweet with referenced_tweets.id: [2080607440866034160].","parameter":"referenced_tweets.id","resource_id":"2080607440866034160","resource_type":"tweet","title":"Not Found Error","type":"https://api.x.com/2/problems/resource-not-found","value":"2080607440866034160"}],"includes":{"tweets":[{"author_id":"1992524300293910528","created_at":"2026-07-30T02:39:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2082657304210776309"],"id":"2082657304210776309","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":32,"impression_count":130984,"like_count":452,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":19,"retweet_count":9},"text":"森の中でも見つけやすいかもっ♩🍃 https://t.co/WeUANU4nj5"}],"users":[{"id":"222316578","name":"梁","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1772826334999502848/ZdX2uBog_normal.jpg","username":"iam678","verified":false},{"id":"1992524300293910528","name":"姫海 のあ","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2034512052446990336/PLh36stn_normal.jpg","username":"menesu_noaa","verified":false}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"2086291987054100908","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3juetjoanqrs24bn2mrswxvao6yl27x","oldest_id":"2079553457586114619","result_count":25}}